            <p>Website toàn cầu: <a href="https://sleepm.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">sleepm.com</a></p>
            <p>Câu hỏi chung: <a href="mailto:info@sleepm.com">info@sleepm.com</a></p>
            <p>Hỗ trợ sản phẩm: <a href="mailto:support@sleepm.com">support@sleepm.com</a></p>
          </article>
